category: Net
build-depends: cygport libwolfssl-devel
sdesc: "Small, fast, portable MQTT client implementation, including support for TLS 1.3 (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "This is an implementation of the MQTT Client written in C for embedded use,
which supports SSL/TLS via the wolfSSL library. This library was built from
the ground up to be multi-platform, space conscience and extensible.
Integrates with wolfSSL to provide TLS support."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfMQTT
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
